# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P4, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0. The bright
# figure is set up before the recording (its moves take ~10 s); the clip starts on it stepping.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w3
tap PLAY
wait 2500
tap EDIT
expect view 4
turn K3 67 40
tap HOME
expect view 0
turn K4 25 60
turn K1 -15 60
tap LFO
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
turn K3 40 60
turn SELECT 55 50
wait 1500
shot figure-0.png
wav figure.wav
# @ the figure stepping: drone II bright, round four notes on LFO II's OR 5
wait 2000
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
# @ Wander up (Pitch moves): every few seconds the whole figure moves to a new note
turn K3 60 40
wait 13000
shot figure-1.png
wavstop
